{"page":{"id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","name":"GitHub","url":"https://www.githubstatus.com","time_zone":"Etc/UTC","updated_at":"2026-08-30T14:13:58.119Z"},"incident":{"id":"fz9sdc2q008p","name":"Actions and Codespaces APIs experiencing partial failures","status":"resolved","created_at":"2026-07-07T14:14:39.966Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T23:39:45.487Z","monitoring_at":"2026-07-07T16:02:02.561Z","resolved_at":"2026-07-07T16:17:16.965Z","impact":"major","shortlink":"https://stspg.io/rmlwm65yzzjj","started_at":"2026-07-07T14:14:39.949Z","page_id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","incident_updates":[{"id":"04snmsszt9t6","status":"resolved","body":"On July 7, 2026, between 14:01 UTC and 16:17 UTC the Actions and Codespaces REST APIs were degraded and returned intermittent 500-class errors for a percentage of requests. Error rates peaked at approximately 8% of Actions runner API requests and 13% of Codespaces API requests, though retries were frequently successful. In-progress Actions runs and Codespaces were not impacted and continued successfully. This was due to a recent change that did not deliver the expected performance and, under certain conditions, caused downstream errors.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe mitigated the incident by rolling back the change, after which the affected services recovered.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe are working to improve the resilience of our services to these conditions and to strengthen our monitoring to reduce our time to detection and mitigation of issues like this one in the future.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T16:17:16.965Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T23:39:45.480Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T16:17:16.965Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"operational","new_status":"operational"}],"deliver_notifications":true,"custom_tweet":null,"tweet_id":null},{"id":"m4pmbp03cq7x","status":"monitoring","body":"The degradation affecting Actions and Codespaces has been mitigated. We are monitoring to ensure stability.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T16:02:02.561Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:02:02.561Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T16:02:02.561Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"operational"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"operational"}],"deliver_notifications":true,"custom_tweet":null,"tweet_id":null},{"id":"fth01ytlmj6j","status":"investigating","body":"We have rolled out the mitigation and are seeing recovery.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T16:00:01.142Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T16:00:01.142Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T16:00:01.142Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"degraded_performance"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}],"deliver_notifications":true,"custom_tweet":null,"tweet_id":null},{"id":"r07csmxqjsbp","status":"investigating","body":"Customers will continue to see 500 errors for approximately 8% of Actions runner REST APIs and 13% of Codespaces REST APIs. Retries may be successful. We have identified a likely cause and are preparing a mitigation.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T15:50:02.072Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T15:50:02.072Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T15:50:02.072Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"degraded_performance"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}],"deliver_notifications":true,"custom_tweet":null,"tweet_id":null},{"id":"88zp9dqv51ys","status":"investigating","body":"Customers accessing Actions runners and Codespaces REST APIs continue to see 500 errors a percentage of the time. Retries may be successful.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe continue to investigate the source of these errors.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T15:06:56.331Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T15:06:56.331Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T15:06:56.331Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"degraded_performance"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}],"deliver_notifications":true,"custom_tweet":null,"tweet_id":null},{"id":"ztcg4f3nxjfy","status":"investigating","body":"Customers accessing the Actions and Codespaces REST APIs may see 500 class errors a percentage of the time.  Retries may be successful.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eActions runs and codespaces  in progress are continuing successfully.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe are continuing to investigate the source of these errors.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T14:47:06.640Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T14:47:06.640Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T14:47:06.640Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"degraded_performance"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"partial_outage","new_status":"partial_outage"}],"deliver_notifications":true,"custom_tweet":null,"tweet_id":null},{"id":"dv7kcxzmqy77","status":"investigating","body":"Codespaces is experiencing degraded availability. We are continuing to investigate.","incident_id":"fz9sdc2q008p","created_at":"2026-07-07T14:32:57.428Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T14:32:57.428Z","display_at":"2026-07-07T14:32:57.428Z","affected_components":[{"code":"br0l2tvcx85d","name":"Actions","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"degraded_performance"},{"code":"h2ftsgbw7kmk","name":"Codespaces","old_status":"degraded_performance","new_status":"partial_outage"}],"deliver_notifications":true,